This is deliberate rather than an oversight. A permissive open-source licence
cannot be revoked once published, so applying one would permanently give away
the ability to sell this, licence it per-customer, or dual-licence it. Reading
the code, learning from it, and opening issues are all welcome; shipping it in
your own product is not, absent an agreement.

To ask about commercial use or a licence, open an issue.
